  "title": "pkix1explicit: Make the OID filterable",
  "description": "pki1explicit's IPAddrAndASCertExtn.asn has a generated member named\n\"id\", a FT_UINT32, that conflicits with the filter abbreviation for\nthe manually generated hf_pkix1explicit_object_identifier_id - both\nuse \"pkix1explicit.id\".\n\nAs they are non-compatible (and refer to quite different things), that\nmakes it impossible to filter for the oid (which is specified second).\nChange the oid filter to \"pkix1explicit.oid\" and make it an FT_OID,\nanalogous with x509if (#18155 / 229dad6a754c4c1840befafd7cc5917b36bd3f53 )",
